25:["$","p",null,{"children":["The 50071 listener loads\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"example-do-not-use-in-prod-rootca.crt"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"example-do-not-use-in-prod-key.pem"}],"\nfrom the same directory. They are committed to the repository, self-signed,\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"CN=localhost"}],", and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"expired in October 2024"}],". Every client must pass\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"--insecure"}]," or equivalent, which is what the repository's own TLS integration\ntest does. No certificate-generation script exists anywhere in the tree; you\nsupply real material yourself."]}]
